WEBVTT

00:14:59.103 --> 00:15:00.356
(Laughter)

00:15:00.955 --> 00:15:03.876
And number four, finally --

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:08.692
and this is probably the most
important aspect of all of this --

00:15:11.653 --> 00:15:15.384
I need you to start taking
yourselves more seriously.

00:15:16.457 --> 00:15:18.727
If there's one thing I've learned

00:15:18.751 --> 00:15:22.610
during seven months
of organizing climate action,

00:15:22.634 --> 00:15:24.952
it's that if you don't go for something,

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:28.525
chances are high that no one else will.

00:15:29.724 --> 00:15:33.340
The most powerful
institutions of this world